        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in boiler condensing modulating 15kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in boiler condensing modulating 15kW
Inventory for 1 MJ natural gas, burned in a gas boiler condensing modulating with a capacity of 15 kW for an one- family house with 2100 operating hours;
Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
UUID: e2a9cc3d-4c2a-3a78-9718-c155941a1f61
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e2a9cc3d-4c2a-3a78-9718-c155941a1f61.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
